pplication to the extent possible and then suspending or referring, as appropriate, the passport application until adequate information and/or documentation is obtained.\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:31dd6334a5a9e99f189c7ab20b3eb838b524a7dda4eb21526ea18399952e40d4\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1282,\"summary\":\"The officer must ensure the passport application is completely acceptable and resolve outstanding issues by adjudicating to the extent possible, then suspending or referring the application until adequate information or documentation is obtained.\",\"target_ids\":[]}",
